  (text "Terminal-device (prosthetic hand) interface: UART 115200 8N1 result packets + two\nfiltered PWM proportional outputs (fc = 16 Hz). Outputs are disabled until the\nprosthetist enables them (firmware TD mode). Hand powered from its own battery."
